<main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow">Why RE-ViVE</div><h1>Every loan. Every payment. Every case.<br/><span class="accent">Exactly as it ran.</span></h1><p class="lede">RE-ViVE reconstructs how work actually executed across your bank, using events and relationships already captured by operational systems. Rather than inferring a representative process, it deterministically rebuilds observed execution — and lets the process map emerge from the evidence.</p><div class="signature">RE-ViVE reconstructs execution instead of inferring a process representation. The process map is the result — not the assumption.</div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#proof">See the head-to-head →</a><a class="btn outline" href="#ai">Where this goes with AI</a></div></div><div class="svg-panel"><svg aria-label="One loan execution: application to KYC, two parallel checks that split and merge at underwriting, an income re-verification loop from approval back to underwriting, then approval and funding." role="img" viewbox="0 0 510 430">
